# Move a book to another browser or computer

SEED.html keeps your books in the browser you use. To work on a book somewhere else, take its EPUB with you.

1. Click [Package EPUB]{.ui}.
2. In the [Share]{.ui} tab, click [Download]{.ui}.
3. Move the file to the other computer, for example by email or a USB drive.
4. There, open SEED.html, click [Open an EPUB…]{.ui} on the [Books]{.ui} screen, and choose the file.

The book opens ready to edit, with its chapters, pictures, cover and details.

The book in the first browser stays where it was. The two copies do not stay in step, so carry on in one place.

This is also a good way to keep a backup: download the EPUB from time to time and keep it somewhere safe.
